            </note>
            <note corresp="#d188-f2" n="7" xml:id="d188-f2-content">
                <p>Major General Frank McIntyre, chief of the Bureau of Insular Affairs, War
                    Department.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d188-f3" n="8" xml:id="d188-f3-content">
                <p>Signed September 1, 1926; <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">vtbf</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
                    pp. 574, 579.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
